@host = http://localhost:3001

### Signup
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana", "apellido": "Prueba", "matricula": "A00000001", "password": "Contrasena123" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "matricula": "A00000001", "password": "Contrasena123" }

### Perfil (usa la cookie del login)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me

### Colarse como admin: debe dar 400
POST {{host}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "X", "apellido": "Y", "matricula": "A00000002", "password": "Contrasena123", "id_rol": 1 }

### Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout